# Motorhead cine v1
# Depth of field sample for #421 (Remaster only; Classic renders it sharp): RedRock, 8 AI cars from the green light.
# A long lens down the start straight looks at the pack coming head-on, focused on the back of the field, then pulls
# focus to the pole car (a rack in 1 / distance from 5.8 to 6.8 s, once the pack is out from behind the bridge). Aperture 0.25 is no real lens: at these distances a
# real f/2 blurs a few pixels at most (20-cine "Depth of field").
